master_sections.original_text:
The user explicitly authorizes this ONE bounded successor campaign to proceed automatically without another
interactive authorization checkpoint, provided every mandatory gate below passes.

Authorized when eligible:

1. authoritative protocol/source research;
2. architecture consolidation of the shared response-side stream state machine;
3. preservation and completion of current partial work;
4. local tests / generated transition-matrix tests / exact historical replay;
5. independent reviewers;
6. commit all local source/test/evidence changes;
7. freeze successor FINAL_EXECUTION_HEAD;
8. materialize fresh successor authorization OUTSIDE Git;
9. execute only still-required real probes sequentially;
10. bounded credential/provider/network/model/paid usage for those probes;
11. promote only workload evidence actually proved;
12. recompute all 183 Exact READY physical request shapes;
13. Exact READY offline Full Short dry run;
14. 13K / 20K / 30K;
15. Strict L3 and fresh reviewers;
16. if every gate passes, execute exactly ONE real Full Short;
17. bounded paid usage for that one Full Short;
18. seal all evidence and stop.

Not authorized:
- second real Full Short;
- open-ended probe retries;
- route/model replacement;
- Long;
- Skill/Hybrid/Selective cutover;
- unrelated external calls;
- request-side redesign unless independently proven necessary.

Fresh child agents are allowed and encouraged for LOCAL/OFFLINE work.

Prefer fork_turns=none where supported.

Parallel work may include:
- protocol research;
- state-machine extraction;
- parser/source tracing;
- historical raw replay;
- transition-matrix generation;
- property/fault tests;
- capture model review;
- request zero-diff review;
- clean-room reviewers;
- successor campaign planning;
- post-run review.

REAL PROVIDER REQUESTS MUST REMAIN SEQUENTIAL.

Do not add new Provider/network concurrency.

Generate tests mechanically from the transition matrix.

For every registered state/event cell that is reachable or intentionally rejected:

- construct deterministic safe event fixture;
- assert exact action;
- assert next state;
- assert primary cause;
- assert content/usage mutation rules;
- assert capture state;
- assert tail diagnostics;
- assert typed terminal family.

Require:

GENERATED_TRANSITION_CASE_COUNT=<n>
GENERATED_TRANSITION_PASS_COUNT=<n>
GENERATED_TRANSITION_COVERAGE=100_PERCENT

No proxy tests using constants that do not execute the owning parser/state-machine transition.
